{"id":"bai-6-cau-truc-re-nhanh-cac-toan-tu-co-ban-trong-c","chapterId":"chuong-1","chapterNumber":1,"chapterTitle":"NHẬP MÔN C++ & KỸ NĂNG SINH TỒN TRONG CONTEST","order":6,"lessonNumber":6,"title":"Bài 6 Cấu trúc rẽ nhánh & Các toán tử cơ bản trong C++","wordCount":237,"estimatedMinutes":4,"headings":[{"level":2,"text":"1. Cấu trúc rẽ nhánh (If-Else, Switch-Case)","id":"1-cau-truc-re-nhanh-if-else-switch-case"},{"level":2,"text":"Switch - Case","id":"switch-case"},{"level":2,"text":"2. Toán tử gán và toán tử toán học","id":"2-toan-tu-gan-va-toan-tu-toan-hoc"},{"level":2,"text":"3. Toán tử so sánh và logic","id":"3-toan-tu-so-sanh-va-logic"},{"level":2,"text":"4. Toán tử tăng giảm và toán tử 3 ngôi","id":"4-toan-tu-tang-giam-va-toan-tu-3-ngoi"},{"level":3,"text":"Tăng giảm","id":"tang-giam"},{"level":2,"text":"5. Độ phức tạp của thuật toán","id":"5-do-phuc-tap-cua-thuat-toan"},{"level":2,"text":"6. Các hệ nhị phân, bát phân, thập lục phân","id":"6-cac-he-nhi-phan-bat-phan-thap-luc-phan"},{"level":3,"text":"In số theo hệ khác trong C++","id":"in-so-theo-he-khac-trong-c"}],"contentHtml":"<h2 id=\"1-cau-truc-re-nhanh-if-else-switch-case\">1. Cấu trúc rẽ nhánh (If-Else, Switch-Case)</h2><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>dieu_kien_1<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý 1</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">else</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>dieu_kien_2<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý 2</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span> <span class=\"tk tk-v\">else</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý còn lại</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"switch-case\">Switch - Case</h2><p>Dùng khi so sánh <strong>một biến</strong> với nhiều <strong>giá trị cụ thể</strong> (số nguyên, ký tự):</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"ln\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">switch</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>x<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">2</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">case</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">1</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">3</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý khi x == 1</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">4</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-v\">break</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">5</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">case</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">2</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">6</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý khi x == 2</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">7</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-v\">break</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">8</span>    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">default</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">9</span>        <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// xử lý khi không khớp case nào</span>\n<span class=\"ln\">10</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> luôn có <code>break</code> sau mỗi <code>case</code>, nếu không chương trình sẽ chạy tiếp xuống case bên dưới <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">fall-through</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.10764em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.03588em;\">ug</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span>.</p><h2 id=\"2-toan-tu-gan-va-toan-tu-toan-hoc\">2. Toán tử gán và toán tử toán học</h2><div class=\"lesson-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Toán tử</th><th>Ý nghĩa</th><th>Ví dụ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>=</code></td><td>Gán</td><td><code>a = 5;</code></td></tr><tr><td><code>+</code>, <code>-</code>, <code>*</code>, <code>/</code>, <code>%</code></td><td>Cộng, trừ, nhân, chia, chia lấy dư</td><td><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a + b,\\ a \\bmod b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6667em; vertical-align: -0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8889em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></td></tr><tr><td><code>+=</code>, <code>-=</code>, <code>*=</code>, <code>/=</code>, <code>%=</code></td><td>Gán kết hợp</td><td><code>a += 3;</code> tương đương <code>a = a + 3;</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> <code>/</code> giữa hai số nguyên là <strong>chia lấy phần nguyên</strong>, <code>%</code> chỉ dùng được với số nguyên.</p><h2 id=\"3-toan-tu-so-sanh-va-logic\">3. Toán tử so sánh và logic</h2><div class=\"lesson-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Toán tử</th><th>Ý nghĩa</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>==</code>, <code>!=</code></td><td>Bằng, khác</td></tr><tr><td><code>&lt;</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, <code>&gt;=</code></td><td>So sánh nhỏ hơn, lớn hơn</td></tr><tr><td><code>&amp;&amp;</code></td><td>Và (AND)</td></tr><tr><td>| |</td><td>Hoặc (OR)</td></tr><tr><td><code>!</code></td><td>Phủ định (NOT)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Ví dụ điều kiện <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10 \\le x \\le 20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.7804em; vertical-align: -0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.7719em; vertical-align: -0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span>:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"tk tk-v\">if</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&gt;=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">10</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&amp;&amp;</span> x <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">20</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">{</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">.</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">.</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">.</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">}</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"4-toan-tu-tang-giam-va-toan-tu-3-ngoi\">4. Toán tử tăng giảm và toán tử 3 ngôi</h2><h3 id=\"tang-giam\">Tăng giảm</h3><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// hậu tố, dùng giá trị cũ trước rồi mới tăng</span>\n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// tiền tố, tăng trước rồi mới dùng giá trị</span>\na<span class=\"tk tk-t\">--</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">--</span>a<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// tương tự với giảm</span></code></pre><p>Toán tử 3 ngôi (ternary)</p><div class=\"lesson-table\"><div data-testid=\"react-katex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mtext>k</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>e</mtext><mo>ˆ</mo></mover><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>t&nbsp;quả</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>đi</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>e</mtext><mo>ˆ</mo></mover><mo>ˋ</mo></mover><mtext>u&nbsp;kiện</mtext></mrow><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">?</mo><mtext>&nbsp;</mtext><mrow><mtext>gi</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>a</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>&nbsp;trị&nbsp;n</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>e</mtext><mo>ˆ</mo></mover><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>u&nbsp;đ</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>u</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>ng</mtext></mrow><mo>:</mo><mrow><mtext>gi</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>a</mtext><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>&nbsp;trị&nbsp;n</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mtext>e</mtext><mo>ˆ</mo></mover><mo>ˊ</mo></mover><mtext>u&nbsp;sai</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\text{kết quả} = \\text{điều kiện} \\ ? \\ \\text{giá trị nếu đúng} : \\text{giá trị nếu sai}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">k</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">t&nbsp;quả</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord latin_fallback\">đ</span><span class=\"mord\">i</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">u&nbsp;kiện</span></span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mclose\">?</span><span class=\"mspace\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;trị&nbsp;n</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">u&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mord latin_fallback\">đ</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">u</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ng</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gi</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">a</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">&nbsp;trị&nbsp;n</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">e</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˆ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˊ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">u&nbsp;sai</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> max_ab <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span>a <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&gt;</span> b<span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">?</span> a <span class=\"tk tk-t\">:</span> b<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"5-do-phuc-tap-cua-thuat-toan\">5. Độ phức tạp của thuật toán</h2><p>Ký hiệu Big-O biểu diễn tốc độ tăng của số phép tính theo <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span>:</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1) &lt; O(\\log n) &lt; O(n) &lt; O(n \\log n) &lt; O(n^2) &lt; O(2^n) &lt; O(n!)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right: 0.01389em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right: 0.01389em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.1141em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top: -3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!)</span></span></span></span></span>\n<p>Ví dụ: vòng lặp lồng đôi duyệt toàn bộ cặp <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i, j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.05724em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> có độ phức tạp <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 1.0641em; vertical-align: -0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right: 0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top: -3.063em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>:</p><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> i<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"tk tk-v\">for</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">(</span><span class=\"tk tk-v\">int</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">=</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">0</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;</span> n<span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span> j<span class=\"tk tk-t\">++</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// O(n^2)</span></code></pre><h2 id=\"6-cac-he-nhi-phan-bat-phan-thap-luc-phan\">6. Các hệ nhị phân, bát phân, thập lục phân</h2><div class=\"lesson-table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Hệ</th><th>Cơ số</th><th>Ký hiệu trong C++</th><th>Ví dụ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Thập phân (Decimal)</td><td>10</td><td>(mặc định)</td><td><code>42</code></td></tr><tr><td>Nhị phân (Binary)</td><td>2</td><td><code>0b</code></td><td><code>0b101010</code></td></tr><tr><td>Bát phân (Octal)</td><td>8</td><td><code>0</code></td><td><code>052</code></td></tr><tr><td>Thập lục phân (Hex)</td><td>16</td><td><code>0x</code></td><td><code>0x2A</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>Cả 4 cách trên đều biểu diễn cùng giá trị:</p>\n<span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mn>42</mn><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mn>101010</mn><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mn>52</mn><mn>8</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>16</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">42_{10} = 101010_2 = 52_8 = 2A_{16}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.7944em; vertical-align: -0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.15em;\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.7944em; vertical-align: -0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10101</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.15em;\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.7944em; vertical-align: -0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.15em;\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right: 0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height: 0.8333em; vertical-align: -0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height: 2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">16</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height: 0.15em;\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>\n<h3 id=\"in-so-theo-he-khac-trong-c\">In số theo hệ khác trong C++</h3><pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code>cout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> hex <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">42</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// in ra 2a</span>\ncout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> oct <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">42</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// in ra 52</span>\ncout <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> dec <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-n\">42</span> <span class=\"tk tk-t\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"tk tk-f\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"tk tk-t\">;</span>   <span class=\"tk tk-c\">// in ra 42 (trở lại hệ 10)</span></code></pre>"}